The cheapest gap in the tests, one at a time, with the checked test that closes it

Usage: njutest next [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --run <RUN>  The run to read. The latest by default
      --take       Take the cheapest checked test without asking, and nothing after it
      --offline    Never touch the network when a taken test is checked again
      --locked     Refuse to change `Cargo.lock` when a taken test is checked again
  -h, --help       Print help
